  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">📋 <strong>使用 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Checkraft</span> 完成所有 Minecraft 挑戰！</strong><br>✅ 追蹤你的進度並分享 — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcheckraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此前往 Checkraft</a></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/399025/description_c5e0c8b0-26a1-4906-a2ae-da3f85625ca1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/399025/description_c5e0c8b0-26a1-4906-a2ae-da3f85625ca1.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p>\n<hr>\n<p>| <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mXqZ2WVY8h\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/838/653/ds_buttonlink.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord 伺服器\" width=\"193\" height=\"50\"></a> |</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@glythex_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/838/654/yt_buttonlink.png\" alt=\"查看我們的 YouTube 頻道\" width=\"193\" height=\"50\"></a></p> |\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/yablon_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_8adcbd14-1f48-412c-98b4-f03dea701632.png\" alt=\"支持我\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">📖 **關於**</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">歡迎遊玩 **Furnitury Mod**，內含 **超過 200 種獨特的家具與裝飾物品**！用時尚且實用的家具改造你的 Minecraft 建築，從舒適的沙發到現代感的椅子，為每個房間增添獨特風格與魅力。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/727/furniture_preview_01-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/727/furniture_preview_01-png.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/728/furniture_preview_02-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/728/furniture_preview_02-png.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/729/furniture_preview_03-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/729/furniture_preview_03-png.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1142/195/coloredpreview-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1142/195/coloredpreview-png.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments